# The desktop CAMERA options sub-screen — the per-player view rows
# (SMOOTHING / ROTATION / ZOOM / SPEED ZOOM for P1..P4), which is where the
# 16-row worst case the D9/O5 row budget was judged on lives now that the
# flat OPTIONS list is 9 rows (options.shot).
#
# options.shot's route (netless build, no save file — see its header for
# what shifts the main-menu rows), then four `key down` past the P1..P4
# SENSITIVITY rows onto the CAMERA opener and enter. Like every menu
# shot, the rows show the local INI's stored values (the harness sandboxes
# writes, not the menu's reading of preferences.ini).
seed 3
menu
sim 3800
key enter 200
key down 700
key enter 1200
key down 1600
key down 2000
key down 2400
key down 2800
key enter 3200
